{{see|cuándo}}
==Spanish==
===Pronunciation===
* /ˈkwando/

===Etymology===
Latin '''[[quando]]'''.

===Adverb===
'''cuando'''
# [[when]] 
[[Category:Spanish adverbs]]

===Conjunction===
'''cuando'''
# [[when]].
#: ''Ven cuando estés listo.''
#: ''Come when you're ready.''
[[Category:Spanish conjunctions]]

===Usage notes===
This same word also functions as the interrogative pronoun ''when?,'' but in such case it is written with an accent mark to distinguish it from these senses: ''¿[[cuándo]]?''

